abstract: >-
  Python implementation of a synthetic discrete-event simulation of dental
  clinic patient flow and reusable instrument-kit availability, with the
  archived results of a factorial experiment comparing appointment spacing and
  readiness-aware dispatch.
keywords:
  - dental operations
  - discrete-event simulation
  - appointment scheduling
  - instrument availability
